# Macro Grammar Specification — Phase 9
#
# Text / Parameterized Macro Definition:
#   macro <name>(<param_1>, <param_2>, ...)
#     <macro_body>
#   end
#
# Macro Invocation:
#   <name>(<arg_1>, <arg_2>, ...)
#
# Inline Macro:
#   <name>() inside text paragraphs
#
# Notes:
# - Macros expand during AST transformation prior to final HTML rendering.
# - Max recursion depth limit: 20 levels (prevents infinite loops).
